|i1 : A = transpose matrix {{0,3},{0,1},{-1,-1},{1,-1},{-4,-2},{4,-2}}        |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = | 0 0 -1 1  -4 4  |                                                     |
|     | 3 1 -1 -1 -2 -2 |                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|              2       6                                                      |
|o1 : Matrix ZZ  <-- ZZ                                                       |
